17. Practical tips to approach 80%+ "correctness"

Aim for high-precision signals (fewer trades, higher confidence). 80% accuracy often means you accept fewer trades with high p.

Use ensemble + probability threshold >0.7 to get high-confidence picks.

Use tight stop management and asymmetric TP/SL (bigger winners).

Monitor regime changes; performance can collapse when regime shifts occur.

